[[16,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Position the tool in the vice.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.012.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Fit the tool (2a) complete with tool (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.050.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.952.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Position the cylinder head (3a) on the supporting tools and fix\nit using the nuts (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015838.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the automatic timing belt tensioner\n(1b).</p><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and remove the fixed timing belt tensioner\n(2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015839.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,127,0,"<p>1. Slacken the bolts (1a) on the camshaft pullies using the tool\n(1b) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure 